The Control class contains quite a few properties that are not "authoritative" at all times due to the value of other properties but they are still always serialized. This results in undefined values being serialized only to be discarded when deserialized as they are unused. I'm not able to maintain a PR for this but I've tried the following patch on my fork and it seems to work for me, however I have custom modifications to this class so the patch may not apply cleanly and the logic will need to be reviewed.

